"c-shiji-010-wendi"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p030","text":"十五年，黃龍見成紀，天子乃復召魯公孫臣，以為博士，申明土德事。於是上乃下詔曰：「有異物之神見于成紀，無害於民，歲以有年。朕親郊祀上帝諸神。禮官議，毋諱以勞朕。」有司禮官皆曰：「古者天子夏躬親禮祀上帝於郊，故曰郊。」於是天子始幸雍，郊見五帝，以孟夏四月答禮焉。趙人新垣平以望氣見，因說上設立渭陽五廟。欲出周鼎，當有玉英見。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"公孫臣","kind":"person","person_id":"4oj_l54_3pa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"諸神","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、群體或神祇指稱未定；不補未見姓名或血親。"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"天子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"古者天子泛稱，不指本朝文帝。"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"五帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、群體或神祇指稱未定；不補未見姓名或血親。"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0131","start":131,"end":134,"surface":"新垣平","kind":"person","person_id":"126_sy4_j11","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p032","text":"十七年，得玉杯，刻曰「人主延壽」。於是天子始更為元年，令天下大酺。其歲，新垣平事覺，夷三族。","annotation_status":"named_mentio